# okf-kb 巡检(心跳/陈旧度/磁盘/僵尸锁/失败批/告警补发) —— 不抢调度锁,在批之间跑。
[Unit]
Description=okf-kb 巡检(dispatch probe)
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=oneshot
User=okfkb
Group=okfkb
WorkingDirectory=/opt/okf-kb
Environment=OKF_KB_ROOT=/opt/okf-kb
ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3 -m pipeline.dispatch probe
TimeoutStartSec=600
Nice=10
SuccessExitStatus=0 1 3
